			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730670301,
					"content": "嗯…兰沙恭，这个兰沙恭就是写下这个笔记的兰那罗吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730670302,
					"content": "笔记上的字怎么一会儿特别大一会儿特别小，大的也就算了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730670303,
					"content": "小的字看的我眼睛都有点疼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730670304,
					"content": "派蒙看小字也会不舒服吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730670305,
					"content": "平时看得都是正常的字，看小字总是会不习惯的啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730670306,
					"content": "唔，这个兰沙恭，难道留下笔记上最新的几页之后就没有再回来吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730670307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730670307,
					"content": "我们现在就去东边的洞窟找找看吧，笔记上写着「勇气」不见了…「勇气」也能不见吗，还真有点好奇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7306704,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7306713
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
